      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲱ ⲡⲉⲛⲧⲁϥ**ⲥⲱⲛⲧ** ⲙⲡⲉⲕⲗⲟⲙ ⲛⲛⲉⲧⲟⲩⲁⲁⲃ ⲧⲏⲣⲟⲩ · ⲙⲛⲛⲉⲓⲟⲩⲟⲧⲟⲩⲉⲧ ⲉⲧⲟϣ · ⲉⲁϥϣⲟⲃⲟⲩ ϩⲛⲛⲉⲣⲱⲙⲉ · ⲡⲉⲕϩⲣⲏⲣⲉ · ⲉⲧⲉⲙⲉϥϩⲱϭⲃ ϣⲁⲃⲟⲗ ·",
      "english": "O Thou Who didst make the crown of all the saints, and these plants which are of many kinds, and hast changed men into Thy flowers which do not wither and fade!",
      "source": "Dormition of John MERC.AD in Budge ed.",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:misc.dormition_john.budge",
